# Vercel installs dependencies from pnpm-lock.yaml during the build. Local installs and
# generated output must never be uploaded as source files (they inflate the upload and can
# exhaust the Hobby API upload quota before the build even starts).
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.media-local
coverage
**/coverage
e2e
tests
docs
.codex
.agents
.claude
.git
*.log
